---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import img1 from '../assets/images/aboutdigital1.png';
import img2 from '../assets/images/aboutdigital2.png';

export interface Props {
  lang: 'en' | 'es';
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
---
<!-- OVERLAPPING PHOTOS SECTION -->
<section id="why-digital" class="bg-card text-primary py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-primary/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Mobile: Images stacked above text -->
      <div class="md:hidden">
        <div class="relative h-[400px] w-full">
           <Image src={img2} class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2/3 h-3/4 object-cover rounded-2xl border-4 border-background shadow-2xl z-10 transition-all duration-500" alt={lang === 'en' ? 'Ana working' : 'Ana trabajando'} />
           <Image src={img1} class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2/3 h-3/4 object-cover object-[70%_center] rounded-2xl border-4 border-background shadow-2xl z-20 transition-all duration-500" alt={lang === 'en' ? 'Digital Business' : 'Negocio Digital'} />
           
           <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-0 z-30 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-card/90 backdrop-blur-md text-sm font-bold shadow-xl text-primary">
              <span class="text-cta">✦</span> {lang === 'en' ? 'Transform your free time into income' : 'Transforma tu tiempo libre en dinero'}
           </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Desktop: Overlapping images -->
      <div class="hidden md:block relative h-[600px] w-full">
         <Image src={img2} class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2/3 h-5/6 object-cover rounded-2xl border-4 border-background shadow-2xl z-10 transition-all duration-500" alt={lang === 'en' ? 'Ana working' : 'Ana trabajando'} />
         <Image src={img1} class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2/3 h-5/6 object-cover object-[70%_center] rounded-2xl border-4 border-background shadow-2xl z-20 transition-all duration-500" alt={lang === 'en' ? 'Digital Business' : 'Negocio Digital'} />
         
         <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 left-0 z-30 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-card/90 backdrop-blur-md text-sm font-bold shadow-xl text-primary">
            <span class="text-cta">✦</span> {lang === 'en' ? 'Transform your free time into income' : 'Transforma tu tiempo libre en dinero'}
         </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Text content -->
      <div class="space-y-6 md:space-y-8">
        <div class="font-outfit flex items-center gap-2 text-cta text-xs md:text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">
          <span>✦</span> {lang === 'en' ? 'High Demand Market' : 'Mercado de Alta Demanda'}
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold leading-tight text-primary">
          {lang === 'en' ? (
            <Fragment>Why start a <br class="hidden md:block"/> Digital Business?</Fragment>
          ) : (
            <Fragment>¿Por qué iniciar un <br class="hidden md:block"/> Negocio Digital?</Fragment>
          )}
        </h2>
        
        <div class="font-outfit space-y-4 md:space-y-6 text-base md:text-lg text-justify text-dark/80">
          {lang === 'en' ? (
            <Fragment>
              <p>
                Traditional jobs are often rigid, but the digital market is expanding rapidly. <strong class="text-primary font-bold">What sets successful professionals apart</strong> is the ability to adapt to new models that offer genuine flexibility and loyalty to your own time.
              </p>
              <p>
                With passive income, <strong class="text-primary font-bold">you open the doors to a global audience</strong> searching for knowledge, tools, and minimalist systems that run on autopilot, a trend growing every single day.
              </p>
              <p>
                And the best part: <strong class="text-primary font-bold">you don't need to speak on camera.</strong> My blueprints teach you exactly how to apply these techniques silently and effectively.
              </p>
            </Fragment>
          ) : (
            <Fragment>
              <p>
                Los trabajos tradicionales suelen ser rígidos, pero el mercado digital se expande rápidamente. <strong class="text-primary font-bold">Lo que diferencia a los profesionales exitosos</strong> es la capacidad de adaptarse a nuevos modelos que ofrecen auténtica flexibilidad y lealtad a tu propio tiempo.
              </p>
              <p>
                Con los ingresos pasivos, <strong class="text-primary font-bold">abres las puertas a una audiencia global</strong> que busca conocimientos, herramientas y sistemas minimalistas que funcionen en piloto automático, una tendencia que crece día a día.
              </p>
              <p>
                Y lo mejor de todo: <strong class="text-primary font-bold">no necesitas hablar a la cámara.</strong> Mis guías te enseñan exactamente cómo aplicar estas técnicas de forma silenciosa y eficaz.
              </p>
            </Fragment>
          )}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
